{"product_id":"butterfly-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-butt-cues-master","title":"Butterfly Maple x Resin (Butt only)","description":"\u003cp class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003e Handcrafted from \u003cstrong\u003epremium Canadian maple\u003c\/strong\u003e, this custom cue butt features a flawlessly executed \u003cstrong\u003ebutterfly splice design\u003c\/strong\u003e enhanced by a lustrous \u003cstrong\u003epearl resin coating\u003c\/strong\u003e, vibrant multi-colored veneers, and meticulously handcrafted \u003cstrong\u003eresin inlays\u003c\/strong\u003e. The flowing symmetry of the butterfly points creates striking visual depth, while the seamless \u003cstrong\u003eresin wrap\u003c\/strong\u003e delivers a sleek, polished feel.\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDesigned for discerning players and collectors, the Butterfly Legacy reflects the craftsmanship, innovation, and attention to detail that define every Cues Master creation. Whether paired with your preferred shaft or displayed as part of a premium collection, it is a cue that celebrates tradition while embracing modern design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 15 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Length:\u003c\/strong\u003e 29.5\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWood:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium Canadian Maple\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConstruction:\u003c\/strong\u003e Handcrafted Butterfly Splice Design, Pearl Resin Coating\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eInlays:\u003c\/strong\u003e Handcrafted Resin Inlays\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVeneers:\u003c\/strong\u003e Multi-Colored Veneers\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWrap